%% Three orchestration layers (+ harness vs workspace inside sandbox)
flowchart TB
  subgraph L3["Layer 3 — Agent session control"]
    direction LR
    ORC[Orchestrator] <-->|prompts · ACP events · permissions · traces| DRV[Driver]
    DRV <-->|ACP| AGENT[Coding agent harness]
    DRV -.->|exec build/test| WSENV[Workspace env]
  end

  subgraph L2["Layer 2 — Workspace provision"]
    direction LR
    DRV2[Driver] --> CLONE[Clone repo onto shared volume]
    CLONE --> DEPS[Install project deps<br/>in workspace container]
    DEPS --> HCFG[Harness config only<br/>stable agent image]
  end

  subgraph L1["Layer 1 — Sandbox lifecycle"]
    direction LR
    SM[Sandbox Manager] --> HOST[Hosting backend<br/>k8s / VM / podman]
    HOST --> BOX[Sandbox unit<br/>harness + workspace containers]
  end

  L3 -.->|runs inside| L1
  L2 -.->|runs inside| L1
  ORC -->|CreateSandbox / Stop / Archive| SM
